description: Supabase schema migration safety
globs: supabase/migrations/**/*.sql
alwaysApply: false
---

# Supabase migrations

- Treat committed migrations as immutable; corrections use a new forward migration.
- Do not run `supabase db push`, `supabase db reset`, or alter a remote schema unless explicitly requested.
- Schema changes and database functions live in `supabase/migrations/`; do not make dashboard-only schema changes.
- Migrations must be backward-compatible with the currently deployed API. Use expand → migrate → contract for destructive changes.
- Never place Supabase access tokens, service/secret keys, or database URLs with credentials in tracked files.
